-BLK-RevC-01,BLOCKED,FPGA_EDA_Toolchain,"Execution of iverilog, vvp, yosys, nextpnr-ice40, and icetime on evt1_ar_display_fpga_bridge_rev_c.v",Sandbox VM environment does not have oss-cad-suite / iverilog / yosys binaries installed and outbound network is disabled,"BLOCKED (NOT marked PASS): RTL instantiates real 4x SB_SPRAM256KA + 2x SB_RAM40_4K, 18-PIO UWG30 PCF, and 60.000Hz timing; awaits binary execution",Run `make -C hardware/evt1-v1-kimi-handoff/rtl all` in GitHub Actions or local workstation with oss-cad-suite.
-BLK-RevC-02,BLOCKED,SoC_BES2800BP_NDA,"BES2800BP 363-ball BGA coordinate table, SDK, EVK, and missing internal Camera ISP",Official Bestechnic 2024/2026 PDFs are 3-page product briefs; full ballmap/SDK require NDA and chip has no internal CSI-2 ISP,BLOCKED: Removed from EVT-1 Rev C schematic freeze; replaced by open-datasheet ESP32-S3-PICO-1-N8R8 + nRF5340-CMAA,Sign Bestechnic NDA + pair with external ISP only for V2.0 evaluation.
