-BLK-RevC-05,BLOCKED,CAD_Native_Gerber_DRC,EasyEDA Pro / KiCad 8 native 6-layer HDI PCB trace routing & Gerber DRC export,Sandbox VM has no GUI PCB CAD binary,"All 42 BOM RefDes (100% of ICs, passives, 6 BTBs, 2 optical engines, 2 GRP3911040 batteries) verified in 3D courtyard check",Import frozen BOM_V1_0_FROZEN.csv and PINMAP_V1_0_FROZEN.csv into EasyEDA Pro / KiCad 8 to export 6L HDI Gerbers.
-UNV-RevC-06,UNVERIFIED,Physical_Hardware_Measurements,"Grepow GRP3911040 (110mAh) pulse voltage sag, 34.73g mass, CoG, RF S11/SAR, and 37.2C thermal rise",Derived from datasheet equations and Grepow catalog specs; physical EVT-1 prototype boards not yet fabricated,UNVERIFIED (NOT marked as measured PASS): Analytical models verified; physical sample tests pending,"Execute discharge curve, 0.01g scale weighing, VNA S11 tuning, and IR thermal scan on first 5 EVT-1 Rev C prototypes."
