+BLK-RevC-02,BLOCKED,CAD_STEP_Shell_and_Gerber_DRC,3D STEP ID Temple Shell Interference (GRP3911040 11.0mm height & ESP32-S3-PICO-1 7.0mm width) + Native 6L HDI Gerber DRC,No vendor 3D STEP enclosure shell (`EVT1_ID_TEMPLE_SHELL.stp`) or GUI PCB CAD binary in sandbox VM; manual bounding-box models cannot substitute for 3D CAD STEP interference checks,"BLOCKED (NOT marked as 0-collision CAD PASS): Analytical audit flags that GRP3911040 (11.0mm H) interferes with a uniform <=7.5mm slim temple by +5.0mm unless rear drop-tip paddle is >=12.8mm tall (or switch to GRP220550 2.38x5.6x50mm 47mAh), and ESP32-S3-PICO-1 (7.0mm W) requires an 8.2mm local PCB flare at Y=4.2..14.0mm",Import ID STEP shell into CAD to confirm >=12.8mm rear drop-tip paddle (or select GRP220550 for slim straight temple) and run native KiCad 8 / EasyEDA Pro 6L Type-III stacked-VIPPO DRC.
