+BLK-RevC-05,BLOCKED,Optical_Engine_NDA,JBD013VGA-G optical engine 3D STEP model & QSPI power-on initialization register LUT,Jade Bird Display proprietary mechanical STEP and init register table require vendor NDA,Frozen 18-PIO UWG30 pinout (shared opt_sck/opt_cs_n + independent opt_l_qdo[3:0] & opt_r_qdo[3:0]) and 6.0x8.0x4.8mm optical bay,Import vendor JBD013VGA_STEP.stp and QSPI init sequence from JBD FAE.
