+# 智元跃动 (Zhiyuan Yuedong) AI/AR 智能眼镜 V1.0 — EVT-1 Rev C (P0 深度整改版) Kimi 工程交接手册
 
-- **仓库基准**：[`yfei7131-source/AI-AR-codex-Claude-`](https://github.com/yfei7131-source/AI-AR-codex-Claude-)（基于 `commit 8eaa633`、Rev B `commit 6eaebe0`、[PR #17 FPGA V2.2-r1](https://github.com/yfei7131-source/AI-AR-codex-Claude-/pull/17) 及 [PR #16 Kimi EVT-0 R9](https://github.com/yfei7131-source/AI-AR-codex-Claude-/pull/16)）
